    {
      "id": "runner-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 742,
      "width": 250.64776611328125,
      "height": 446.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g-runner"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 298541198,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1636084763,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793468875785,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Own consumer group for\neach worker\n\nCommits the offset only after\nthe result is saved\n\nheartbeat() during long work\n\nModels take turns in one\nprocess to save memory\n\nReplays are safe: DELETE +\nINSERT in one transaction\n\nDone: sets <name>_done.\nThe last one sets ready\n\nError: status = failed + error\n\nKafka error: no commit, so\nthe message comes back",
      "originalText": "Own consumer group for\neach worker\n\nCommits the offset only after\nthe result is saved\n\nheartbeat() during long work\n\nModels take turns in one\nprocess to save memory\n\nReplays are safe: DELETE +\nINSERT in one transaction\n\nDone: sets <name>_done.\nThe last one sets ready\n\nError: status = failed + error\n\nKafka error: no commit, so\nthe message comes back",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
