      "updated": 1793468875785,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Merge nearby hits, keep the top 10\nSame video, gap of 10s or less. Jump to the best moment, not the earliest\nNo matching frame? Use the nearest frame as the thumbnail",
      "originalText": "Merge nearby hits, keep the top 10\nSame video, gap of 10s or less. Jump to the best moment, not the earliest\nNo matching frame? Use the nearest frame as the thumbnail",
